 🛡 GigShield Mini Pro

GigShield Mini Pro is a **mobile-first React web application** that simulates an **AI-powered micro-insurance system for gig workers** (such as delivery drivers).

The app demonstrates how real-time disruptions (rain, heat, roadblocks) can automatically trigger **instant claim approval and payouts**, reducing manual effort and delays.

---

 🚀 Problem Statement

Gig workers face unpredictable risks such as:

- 🌧 Sudden rain interruptions  
- 🔥 Extreme heat conditions  
- 🚧 Roadblocks and traffic issues  
- ⚡ Network failures  

These disruptions directly impact their daily earnings, and traditional insurance systems are:

- Slow  
- Manual  
- Not real-time  

---

 💡 Solution

GigShield Mini Pro provides a **smart, automated insurance simulation** that:

- Detects disruptions  
- Evaluates eligibility instantly  
- Approves claims automatically  
- Credits payouts in real time  

---
 ✨ Key Features

 📊 Dashboard
- Displays user details (Dilshand)
- Weekly plan: ₹25/week
- Coverage limit: ₹500
- Status: Active
- Dynamic risk level:
  - 🟢 Low
  - 🟠 Medium
  - 🔴 High

---

🤖 AI Risk Prediction
- Predicts upcoming risks (e.g., rain probability)
- Provides smart suggestions:
  > "Pause work due to high risk"

---

🌦 Disruption Simulation

Users can simulate real-world events:

- 🌧 Rain  
- 🔥 Heatwave  
- 🚧 Road Block  
- ⚡ Network Issue  

---

⚡Automated Claim Flow

Step-by-step simulation:

1. Disruption detected  
2. Checking eligibility  
3. Claim approved  
4. Payout credited  

---

💰 Wallet System
- Displays user balance  
- Updates after every payout  

---

 📈 Earnings Tracker
- Shows protected earnings  
- Progress bar (capped at 100%)

---

📜 Claim History
- Displays all past claims  
- Includes:
  - Type (Rain, Heat, etc.)
  - Amount
  - Status (Paid)
  - Date


 🧭 Navigation
- Home (Dashboard)
- Claims (History)



 🖥️ Tech Stack

| Technology       |      Usage         |
|------------------|--------------------|
| React.js         | Frontend framework |
| React Router     | Navigation         |
| CSS              | Styling            |
| JavaScript (ES6) | Logic              |
| React Hooks      | State management   |


🎨 UI/UX Design

- Mobile-first layout (375px width)
- Clean fintech-inspired UI
- Gradient background
- Card-based design
- Smooth transitions and visual feedback

Color System:
- 🟢 Green → Safe / Success  
- 🔴 Red → Risk / Alert  
- 🟠 Orange → Warning  

---

🔄 Application Flow
User selects disruption
↓
System detects event
↓
Eligibility check
↓
Claim approved
↓
Payout credited
↓
History updated

💡 Future Enhancements

🌍 Real-time weather API integration
📍 Location-based risk detection
🔐 User authentication
📊 Advanced analytics dashboard
🤖 Machine learning-based prediction model

